          {
            "title": "Returning values",
            "id": 74277,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Una funzione può restituire un valore al codice che l'ha chiamata. Questa pagina web restituisce un valore al codice che l'ha chiamata per aiutarla a svolgere il suo compito.</p><webview version=\"2\" visible-if=\"always\" content=\"&lt;!doctype html&gt;&#xA;&lt;html&gt;&#xA; &lt;head&gt;&#xA;  &lt;style&gt;&#xA;   body {&#xA;    text-align: center;&#xA;    font-size: 16px;&#xA;    margin: 0 auto;&#xA;    background-color: #D5F5E3&#xA;   }&#xA;   &#xA;   button {&#xA;    background-color: #85C1E9;&#xA;    border: none;&#xA;    border-radius: 8px;&#xA;    color: white;&#xA;    text-align: center;&#xA;    text-decoration: none;&#xA;    display: inline-block;&#xA;    font-size: 14px;&#xA;    padding: 6px 12px;&#xA;    margin: 0 12px 0 0;&#xA;   }&#xA;   &#xA;   h2 {&#xA;    color: #7c795d;&#xA;    font-family: 'Trocchi', serif;&#xA;    font-size: 45px;&#xA;    font-weight: normal;&#xA;    line-height: 48px;&#xA;    margin: 0;&#xA;    text-align: centre&#xA;   }&#xA;   &#xA;   #playerList {&#xA;    text-align: left;&#xA;   }&#xA;  &lt;/style&gt;&#xA; &lt;/head&gt;&#xA; &lt;body id=&quot;main&quot;&gt;&#xA;  &lt;h2&gt;Pound Converter&lt;/h2&gt;&#xA;  &lt;p&gt;Add value in pounds.&lt;/p&gt;&#xA;  &lt;p&gt;&#xA;   &lt;label&gt;Pounds&lt;/label&gt;&#xA;   &lt;input id=&quot;inputPounds&quot; type=&quot;number&quot; placeholder=&quot;Pounds&quot;&gt;&#xA;  &lt;/p&gt;&#xA;  &lt;button onClick=&quot;convert()&quot;&gt;convert&lt;/button&gt;&#xA;  &lt;p&gt;Kilograms: &lt;span id=&quot;outputKilograms&quot;&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&#xA;  &lt;script&gt;&#xA;   function convert() {&#xA;    const pounds = document.getElementById(&quot;inputPounds&quot;).value;&#xA;    document.getElementById(&quot;outputKilograms&quot;).innerHTML = pounds /&#xA;     2.2046;&#xA;   }&#xA;  &lt;/script&gt;&#xA; &lt;/body&gt;&#xA;&lt;/html&gt;\" /></body></html>",
            "hardModeSelected": true
          },
          {
            "title": "Return",
            "id": 74278,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Per restituire qualcosa da una funzione, aggiungi la parola chiave <code>return</code> seguita dal valore da restituire, come qui con <code>return age;</code>.</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"javascript\" name=\"script.js\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"function\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"userAge\" class=\"title\" /><text value=\"(\" /><text value=\"number\" class=\"params\" /><text value=\") \" /><text value=\"{\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"const\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" age = \" /><text value=\"&quot;User age: &quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\" + number;\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"return\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" age;\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"}\" /></content><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option startIndex=\"64\" endIndex=\"70\" /><option startIndex=\"71\" endIndex=\"74\" /><option startIndex=\"74\" endIndex=\"75\" /></options></interaction></interactions></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Assicurati di scegliere <code>return</code>, seguito da <code>age</code> e infine <code>;</code>.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Per restituire qualcosa da una funzione aggiungiamo la parola chiave <code>return</code> seguita dal valore da restituire. Restituisci l'età memorizzata.</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"javascript\" name=\"script.js\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"function\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"userAge\" class=\"title\" /><text value=\"(\" /><text value=\"number\" class=\"params\" /><text value=\") \" /><text value=\"{\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"const\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" age = \" /><text value=\"&quot;User age: &quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\" + number;\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"return\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" age;\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"}\" /></content><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option startIndex=\"64\" endIndex=\"70\" /><option startIndex=\"71\" endIndex=\"74\" /><option startIndex=\"74\" endIndex=\"75\" /><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"console.log\" /></content></option><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"number\" /></content></option><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"undefined\" /></content></option></options></interaction></interactions></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Assicurati di scegliere <code>return</code>, seguito da <code>age</code> e infine <code>;</code>.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Any type",
            "id": 74279,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Una funzione può restituire un valore di qualsiasi tipo, come una stringa, un numero o un booleano. Questa funzione restituisce il valore numerico contenuto in <code>result</code>.</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"javascript\" name=\"script.js\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"function\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"timesTen\" class=\"title\" /><text value=\"(\" /><text value=\"number\" class=\"params\" /><text value=\") \" /><text value=\"{\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"const\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" result = number * \" /><text value=\"10\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\";\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"return\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" result;\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"}\" /></content><interactions><interaction type=\"validatedInput\" isDefault=\"true\" startIndex=\"65\" endIndex=\"71\" /></interactions></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Assicurati di digitare <code>result</code>.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Return",
            "id": 74305,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Possiamo restituire un solo valore. Qui restituiamo il valore booleano contenuto nella variabile con <code>return isGreater;</code>.</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"javascript\" name=\"script.js\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"function\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"greaterThanTen\" class=\"title\" /><text value=\"(\" /><text value=\"number\" class=\"params\" /><text value=\") \" /><text value=\"{\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"const\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" isGreater = number &gt; \" /><text value=\"10\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\";\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"return\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" isGreater;\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"}\" /></content><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option startIndex=\"67\" endIndex=\"73\" /><option startIndex=\"74\" endIndex=\"83\" /><option startIndex=\"83\" endIndex=\"84\" /></options></interaction></interactions></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Assicurati di scegliere <code>return</code>, seguito da <code>isGreater</code> e infine <code>;</code>.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Possiamo restituire un solo valore. Restituisci il valore booleano memorizzato in <code>isGreater</code>.</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"javascript\" name=\"script.js\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"function\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"greaterThanTen\" class=\"title\" /><text value=\"(\" /><text value=\"number\" class=\"params\" /><text value=\") \" /><text value=\"{\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"const\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" isGreater = number &gt; \" /><text value=\"10\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\";\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"return\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" isGreater;\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"}\" /></content><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option startIndex=\"67\" endIndex=\"73\" /><option startIndex=\"74\" endIndex=\"83\" /><option startIndex=\"83\" endIndex=\"84\" /><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"console.log\" /></content></option><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"number\" /></content></option><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"undefined\" /></content></option></options></interaction></interactions></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Assicurati di scegliere <code>return</code>, seguito da <code>isGreater</code> e infine <code>;</code>.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Using the return value",
            "id": 74306,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Possiamo usare il valore restituito da una funzione come qualsiasi altro valore chiamando la funzione. Qui chiamiamo <code>userAge(22)</code> per usare il suo valore.</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"javascript\" name=\"script.js\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"function\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"userAge\" class=\"title\" /><text value=\"(\" /><text value=\"number\" class=\"params\" /><text value=\") \" /><text value=\"{\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"const\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" age = \" /><text value=\"&quot;User age: &quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\" + number;\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"return\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" age;\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"}\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".log(userAge(\" /><text value=\"22\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\"));\" /></content><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option startIndex=\"90\" endIndex=\"97\" /><option startIndex=\"97\" endIndex=\"98\" /><option startIndex=\"98\" endIndex=\"100\" /><option startIndex=\"100\" endIndex=\"101\" /></options></interaction></interactions><output><content><text value=\"User age: 22\" /></content></output></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Assicurati di scegliere <code>userAge</code>, seguito da <code>(</code> e poi <code>22</code>, <code>)</code>.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Possiamo usare il valore restituito da una funzione come qualsiasi altro valore chiamando la funzione. Chiama <code>userAge</code> con <code>22</code> e visualizza il suo valore.</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"javascript\" name=\"script.js\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"function\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"userAge\" class=\"title\" /><text value=\"(\" /><text value=\"number\" class=\"params\" /><text value=\") \" /><text value=\"{\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"const\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" age = \" /><text value=\"&quot;User age: &quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\" + number;\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"return\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" age;\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"}\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".log(userAge(\" /><text value=\"22\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\"));\" /></content><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option startIndex=\"90\" endIndex=\"97\" /><option startIndex=\"97\" endIndex=\"98\" /><option startIndex=\"98\" endIndex=\"100\" /><option startIndex=\"100\" endIndex=\"101\" /><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"age\" /></content></option><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"number\" /></content></option><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"29\" /></content></option></options></interaction></interactions><output><content><text value=\"User age: 22\" /></content></output></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Assicurati di scegliere <code>userAge</code>, seguito da <code>(</code>, <code>22</code> e infine <code>)</code>.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Storing it in a variable",
            "id": 74307,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Possiamo anche memorizzare il valore restituito in una variabile. Qui memorizziamo il valore restituito in <code>result</code> e lo visualizziamo nella console.</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"javascript\" name=\"script.js\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"function\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"userAge\" class=\"title\" /><text value=\"(\" /><text value=\"number\" class=\"params\" /><text value=\") \" /><text value=\"{\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"const\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" age = \" /><text value=\"&quot;User age: &quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\" + number;\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"return\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" age;\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"}\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"const\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" result = userAge(\" /><text value=\"29\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\");\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".log(result);\" /></content><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option startIndex=\"84\" endIndex=\"90\" /><option startIndex=\"106\" endIndex=\"113\" /><option startIndex=\"113\" endIndex=\"114\" /><option startIndex=\"114\" endIndex=\"117\" /><option startIndex=\"118\" endIndex=\"124\" /></options></interaction></interactions><output><content><text value=\"User age: 29\" /></content></output></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Assicurati di scegliere <code>result</code>, seguito da <code>console</code> e poi <code>.</code>, <code>log</code>, <code>result</code>.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Possiamo memorizzare un valore restituito in una variabile. Memorizza l'età restituita in <code>result</code>, quindi visualizza quella variabile.</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"javascript\" name=\"script.js\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"function\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"userAge\" class=\"title\" /><text value=\"(\" /><text value=\"number\" class=\"params\" /><text value=\") \" /><text value=\"{\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"const\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" age = \" /><text value=\"&quot;User age: &quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\" + number;\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"return\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" age;\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"}\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"const\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" result = userAge(\" /><text value=\"29\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\");\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".log(result);\" /></content><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option startIndex=\"84\" endIndex=\"90\" /><option startIndex=\"93\" endIndex=\"100\" /><option startIndex=\"101\" endIndex=\"103\" /><option startIndex=\"106\" endIndex=\"113\" /><option startIndex=\"118\" endIndex=\"124\" /><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"age\" /></content></option><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"number\" /></content></option><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"22\" /></content></option></options></interaction></interactions><output><content><text value=\"User age: 29\" /></content></output></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Assicurati di scegliere <code>result</code>, seguito da <code>userAge</code>, <code>29</code>, <code>console</code> e infine <code>result</code>.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "No return statement",
            "id": 74308,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Se non includiamo un'istruzione <code>return</code>, la funzione restituisce invece il valore <code>undefined</code>.</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"javascript\" name=\"script.js\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"function\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"userAge\" class=\"title\" /><text value=\"(\" /><text value=\"number\" class=\"params\" /><text value=\") \" /><text value=\"{\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"const\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" age = \" /><text value=\"&quot;User age: &quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\" + number;\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"}\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"const\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" result = userAge(\" /><text value=\"29\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\");\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".log(result);\" /></content><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option startIndex=\"105\" endIndex=\"111\" /></options></interaction></interactions><output><content><text value=\"undefined\" /></content></output></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Assicurati di scegliere <code>result</code>.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Usa <code>return</code> seguito da un valore per restituirlo, come <code>return age;</code>. Puoi memorizzare il valore restituito in una variabile.</p><p>Senza un’istruzione <code>return</code>, la funzione restituisce <code>undefined</code>. Registra il risultato memorizzato della funzione.</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"javascript\" name=\"script.js\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"function\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"userAge\" class=\"title\" /><text value=\"(\" /><text value=\"number\" class=\"params\" /><text value=\") \" /><text value=\"{\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"const\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" age = \" /><text value=\"&quot;User age: &quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\" + number;\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"}\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"const\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" result = userAge(\" /><text value=\"29\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\");\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".log(result);\" /></content><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option startIndex=\"105\" endIndex=\"111\" /><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"age\" /></content></option><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"number\" /></content></option><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"userAge\" /></content></option></options></interaction></interactions><output><content><text value=\"undefined\" /></content></output></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Assicurati di scegliere <code>result</code>.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeSelected": true
          },
          {
            "title": "Question: Return",
            "id": 74317,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Come restituiamo un valore da una funzione?</p><selection iscode=\"false\" multiple=\"multiple\"><item value=\"1\" correct=\"true\">Aggiungendo la parola chiave return seguita dal valore da restituire</item><item value=\"2\" correct=\"false\">Aggiungendo il valore e poi la parola chiave return nella riga successiva</item></selection><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Aggiungendo la parola chiave return seguita dal valore da restituire.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Quale riga restituisce correttamente da una funzione il valore contenuto in <code>total</code>?</p><selection iscode=\"false\" multiple=\"multiple\"><item value=\"1\" correct=\"true\"><code>return total;</code></item><item value=\"2\" correct=\"false\"><code>total return;</code></item><item value=\"3\" correct=\"false\"><code>return = total;</code></item></selection><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Assicurati di scegliere <code>return total;</code>.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Question: Any type",
            "id": 74318,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Quale tipo di valore può restituire una funzione?</p><selection iscode=\"false\" multiple=\"multiple\"><item value=\"1\" correct=\"true\">Una funzione può restituire qualsiasi tipo di valore, ad esempio una stringa, un numero o un valore booleano</item><item value=\"2\" correct=\"false\">Una funzione può restituire solo stringhe e numeri</item></selection><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Una funzione può restituire qualsiasi tipo di valore, ad esempio una stringa, un numero o un valore booleano.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Una funzione può restituire una stringa, un numero o un valore booleano.</p><p>Quale istruzione restituisce il risultato booleano della verifica <code>10 &gt; 5</code>?</p><selection iscode=\"false\" multiple=\"multiple\"><item value=\"1\" correct=\"true\"><code>return true;</code></item><item value=\"2\" correct=\"false\"><code>return false;</code></item><item value=\"3\" correct=\"false\"><code>return \"true\";</code></item></selection><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Assicurati di scegliere <code>return true;</code>.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeSelected": true
          },
          {
            "title": "Question: Return",
            "id": 74319,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Qual è il numero di valori che una funzione può restituire?</p><selection iscode=\"false\" multiple=\"multiple\"><item value=\"1\" correct=\"true\">Una funzione può restituire un singolo valore</item><item value=\"2\" correct=\"false\">Le funzioni possono restituire più valori</item></selection><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Una funzione può restituire un singolo valore.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Una funzione raggiunge <code>return score;</code>. Quanti valori restituisce questa istruzione?</p><selection iscode=\"false\" multiple=\"multiple\"><item value=\"1\" correct=\"true\">Un valore.</item><item value=\"2\" correct=\"false\">Un valore per ogni variabile nella funzione.</item><item value=\"3\" correct=\"false\">Tutti i valori calcolati dalla funzione.</item></selection><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Un valore.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Question: Using the return value",
            "id": 74320,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Come si usa il valore restituito da una funzione?</p><selection iscode=\"false\" multiple=\"multiple\"><item value=\"1\" correct=\"true\">Chiamiamo la funzione e la usiamo come qualsiasi altro valore</item><item value=\"2\" correct=\"false\">Non chiamiamo la funzione se vogliamo usare il valore restituito</item></selection><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Chiamiamo la funzione e la usiamo come qualsiasi altro valore.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Usiamo un valore restituito chiamando la sua funzione come qualsiasi altro valore. Per sommare <code>getPoints()</code> a un numero, cosa devi fare prima?</p><selection iscode=\"false\" multiple=\"multiple\"><item value=\"1\" correct=\"true\">Chiamare <code>getPoints()</code> e usare il valore restituito.</item><item value=\"2\" correct=\"false\">Usare <code>getPoints</code> senza parentesi.</item><item value=\"3\" correct=\"false\">Inserire <code>return</code> prima della chiamata di funzione.</item></selection><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Chiamare <code>getPoints()</code> e usare il valore restituito.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Question: Storing it in a variable",
            "id": 74321,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Come memorizziamo il valore restituito in una variabile?</p><selection iscode=\"false\" multiple=\"multiple\"><item value=\"1\" correct=\"true\">Chiamiamo la funzione e la memorizziamo in una variabile </item><item value=\"2\" correct=\"false\">Aggiungiamo la variabile alla fine della funzione</item></selection><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Chiamiamo la funzione e la memorizziamo in una variabile .</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Quale riga memorizza in <code>name</code> il valore restituito da <code>getName()</code>?</p><selection iscode=\"false\" multiple=\"multiple\"><item value=\"1\" correct=\"true\"><code>const name = getName();</code></item><item value=\"2\" correct=\"false\"><code>const name = return getName();</code></item><item value=\"3\" correct=\"false\"><code>const getName = name;</code></item></selection><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Assicurati di scegliere <code>const name = getName();</code>.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Question: No return statement",
            "id": 74322,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Cosa succede quando non includiamo l'istruzione <code>return</code> nella nostra funzione?</p><selection iscode=\"false\" multiple=\"multiple\"><item value=\"1\" correct=\"true\">La funzione restituisce il valore <code>undefined</code></item><item value=\"2\" correct=\"false\">C'è un ciclo infinito nella funzione</item></selection><p visible-if=\"wrong\">La funzione restituisce il valore <code>undefined</code>.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Una funzione crea <code>age = 29</code>, ma non ha <code>return</code>. Cosa viene memorizzato assegnando la sua chiamata a <code>result</code>?</p><selection iscode=\"false\" multiple=\"multiple\"><item value=\"1\" correct=\"true\"><code>undefined</code></item><item value=\"2\" correct=\"false\"><code>29</code></item><item value=\"3\" correct=\"false\"><code>\"age\"</code></item></selection><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Assicurati di scegliere <code>undefined</code>.</p></body></html>",
